        "TileImage": "$($repository 04fb5d48-df21-47ad-8027-b57db95a7367).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rA concealed criminal operation is embedded within the Milton-Fitzpatrick Bank. Joss &amp; Roy have positioned bank teller Julianne Cason and officer Milton Laprade to quietly defraud local residents, shielded by routine and authority. Oversight has collapsed.\r\rRemove both targets and ensure the operation ends here.\r\rI’ll leave you to prepare.",
